 for example here the cold sort  of envelops you or surrounds you an  array of decorative objects from Asia  and Africa give a sense of ethnic  identity and soul to this home in the  middle of Berlin wooden chairs animal  pelts and hand-woven carpets create a  rustic feel and infuse the airy space  with boho chic touches the artists  collective Slavs and Tatars feel at home  in this cozy space the living room is  dominated by a large daybed this is  called a Toth or we call it a river bed  it's a kind of vernacular piece of  furniture that you find often outside  near a river in cafes in parks and in  places like Iran where unmarried men and  women can't socialize together the river  bed becomes one of the unique spots  where women and men can mingle  traditional handiwork combined with  contemporary art this apartments  eclectic mix of styles is as much an  invitation to settle as it is to travel  the world  you
 

